    citation: "Arizona Dept. of Revenue, 2025 Form 140 Resident Personal Income Tax Return instructions, https://azdor.gov/sites/default/files/document/FORMS_INDIVIDUAL_2025_140i.pdf - 'Line 46 - Tax Amount: Multiply line 45 by 2.5% (.025) and enter the result.'",
