    citation: "Published 2026 threshold: Massachusetts DOR 'Tax Rates' page (updated Dec 30, 2025), https://www.mass.gov/info-details/massachusetts-tax-rates (read via web.archive.org capture because mass.gov returned 403 to automated fetch) - 'Tax year 2026: For income exceeding $1,107,750, there is an additional surtax of 4%.' (also in DOR 2026 Form 1-ES instructions); 5.00% rate continues ('Long term capital gains from dividends, interest, wages, and other income 5.00%').",
