    value: {"single": [{"over": 0, "rate": 0.015}, {"over": 5500, "rate": 0.032}, {"over": 16500, "rate": 0.043}, {"over": 33500, "rate": 0.047}, {"over": 66500, "rate": 0.049}, {"over": 210000, "rate": 0.059}], "mfj": [{"over": 0, "rate": 0.015}, {"over": 8000, "rate": 0.032}, {"over": 25000, "rate": 0.043}, {"over": 50000, "rate": 0.047}, {"over": 100000, "rate": 0.049}, {"over": 315000, "rate": 0.059}], "mfs": [{"over": 0, "rate": 0.015}, {"over": 4000, "rate": 0.032}, {"over": 12500, "rate": 0.043}, {"over": 25000, "rate": 0.047}, {"over": 50000, "rate": 0.049}, {"over": 157500, "rate": 0.059}], "hoh": [{"over": 0, "rate": 0.015}, {"over": 8000, "rate": 0.032}, {"over": 25000, "rate": 0.043}, {"over": 50000, "rate": 0.047}, {"over": 100000, "rate": 0.049}, {"over": 315000, "rate": 0.059}], "qss": [{"over": 0, "rate": 0.015}, {"over": 8000, "rate": 0.032}, {"over": 25000, "rate": 0.043}, {"over": 50000, "rate": 0.047}, {"over": 100000, "rate": 0.049}, {"over": 315000, "rate": 0.059}], "simplified": false, "note": "NMSA 7-2-7 as amended by Laws 2024 HB 252 (applies to taxable years beginning on or after Jan 1, 2025; not indexed). Schedule A covers MFJ, heads of household and surviving spouses (so hoh and qss use the joint schedule); B single; C MFS. Base check: A 8,000x1.5%=120; +17,000x3.2%=664; +25,000x4.3%=1,739; +50,000x4.7%=4,089; +215,000x4.9%=14,624 - agree; B 82.50/434.50/1,165.50/2,716.50/9,748 agree; C 60/332/869.50/2,044.50/7,312 agree. Official tax rate tables use $50 bands - not modeled."},
    citation: "Enacted statute: Laws 2024, HB 252 (final), https://www.nmlegis.gov/Sessions/24%20Regular/final/HB0252.pdf, Section 5 amending NMSA 7-2-7: 'for any taxable year beginning on or after January 1, 2025: A. For married individuals filing joint returns, heads of household and surviving spouses: Not over $8,000 1.5% ...; Over $8,000 but not over $25,000 $120 plus 3.2% ...; Over $25,000 but not over $50,000 $664 plus 4.3% ...; Over $50,000 but not over $100,000 $1,739 plus 4.7% ...; Over $100,000 but not over $315,000 $4,089 plus 4.9% ...; Over $315,000 $14,624 plus 5.9% ... B. For single individuals ... Not over $5,500 1.5% ... Over $210,000 $9,748 plus 5.9% ... C. For married individuals filing separate returns: Not over $4,000 1.5% ... Over $157,500 $7,312 plus 5.9%'. Section 42(B): Section 5 applies to taxable years beginning on or after January 1, 2025.",
