    citation: "Enrolled HB 2764 (2025), amending 68 O.S. Sec. 2355, effective Nov 1, 2025, https://www.oklegislature.gov/cf_pdf/2025-26%20ENR/hB/HB2764%20ENR.PDF, 68 O.S. Sec. 2355(C) 'tax years 2024 and 2025': single/MFS '0.25% tax on first $1,000.00 ... 0.75% tax on next $1,500.00 ... 1.75% tax on next $1,250.00 ... 2.75% tax on next $1,150.00 ... 3.75% tax on next $2,300.00 ... 4.75% tax on the remainder'; joint/surviving spouse/HOH '0.25% on first $2,000.00 ... 0.75% on next $3,000.00 ... 1.75% on next $2,500.00 ... 2.75% on next $2,300.00 ... 3.75% on next $4,600.00 ... 4.75% on the remainder'. Cross-check: 2025 Oklahoma Resident Individual Income Tax Forms and Instructions (Form 511 packet), https://oklahoma.gov/content/dam/ok/en/tax/documents/forms/individuals/current/511-Pkt.pdf p.38 'Tax on $100,000 4,562' (single/MFS) and '4,373' (joint/HOH), 'Multiply Line 3 by 0.0475'.",
