    citation: "Wis. Stat. 71.06, https://docs.legis.wisconsin.gov/statutes/statutes/71/i/06 - (1r) \"On all taxable income from $0 to $14,680, 3.50 percent.\" \"exceeding $14,680 but not exceeding $50,480, 4.40 percent.\" \"exceeding $50,480 but not exceeding $323,290, 5.30 percent.\" \"exceeding $323,290, 7.65 percent.\"; (2)(k) MFJ $19,580 / $67,300 / $431,060; (2)(L) MFS $9,790 / $33,650 / $215,530. Cross-checked to Wisconsin Department of Revenue, 2025 Form 1 Instructions, https://www.revenue.wi.gov/TaxForms2025/2025-Form1-Inst.pdf Tax Computation Worksheet: \"$323,290 or over x 7.65% (.0765) ... $8,183.76\"; MFJ \"$431,060 or over ... $10,911.83\"; MFS \"$215,530 or over ... $5,455.92\".",
