    citation: "West Virginia Enrolled Committee Substitute for S.B. 392 (2026 Regular Session, passed March 14, 2026), https://www.wvlegislature.gov/Bill_Text_HTML/2026_SESSIONS/RS/bills/sb392%20sub1%20enr.pdf - new W. Va. Code 11-21-4j \"Rate of tax - Taxable years beginning on and after January 1, 2026\": \"Not over $10,000 2.11% of the taxable income\"; \"Over $10,000 but not over $25,000 $211 plus 2.81%\"; \"Over $25,000 but not over $40,000 $632.50 plus 3.16%\"; \"Over $40,000 but not over $60,000 $1,106.50 plus 4.22%\"; \"Over $60,000 $1,950.50 plus 4.58% of excess over $60,000\". MFS: \"Not over $5,000 2.11%\"; \"$105.50 plus 2.81% of excess over $5,000\"; \"$316.25 plus 3.16% of excess over $12,500\"; \"$553.25 plus 4.22% of excess over $20,000\"; \"$975.25 plus 4.58% of excess over $30,000\". (enacted statute)",
